cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Aditya-L1 ASPEX-SWIS CME Detection Pipeline"
authors:
  - name: "Arinjay"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aur1ety/Model-for-Coronal-Mass-Ejection-detection"
abstract: >-
  Coronal Mass Ejection detection from in-situ solar-wind plasma measurements
  (archived ISRO Aditya-L1 ASPEX-SWIS Level-2 data) using a causal temporal
  convolutional network (TCN). A research prototype.
  Only the TCN validation F1 (0.3101) has been reproduced in a later re-run, on a
  random split of overlapping windows (held-out test F1 0.25); the May 2026
  blind-test results are logged, not reproduced. Companion to Magnuson (MAG magnetometer)
  and Roentgen (SoLEXS/HEL1OS X-ray) — three instruments, one mission.
keywords:
  - coronal mass ejection
  - solar wind
  - Aditya-L1
  - machine learning
